            <description><![CDATA[<h2>FnMacAssistant v2.0 beta 6</h2>
<br>
<h3>New tab: Data Manager</h3>
- Delete selected bundles<br>
- Create archive of selected bundles<br>
- Import archive button<br>
- Delete Fortnite and all data button<br>
- Data relocator with external drive support (Requires external drive to be high speed)<br>
<br>
<h3>Bug fixes and other small updates</h3>
- Fixed a bug where placeholder files were not renaming correctly, causing connection errors and 50B updates that never complete.<br>
- Clicking on download bubble on sidebar now takes you to the respective tab<br>
<br>
(Plus other bug fixes I might have forgotten about lol)
]]></description>
